{"id":"1954859717676496271","kind":"article","title":"陶哲轩的数学职业建议","author":"Terence Tao","original_authors":["Terence Tao"],"original_source_urls":["https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"Terry Tao","date":"2025-09-27","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":87,"comment_count":2,"minutes":5,"chars":2183,"keywords":["数学职业规划","数学研究","导师沟通","学术生涯","解题能力","时间管理"],"summary":"译文汇集陶哲轩对数学学术生涯各阶段的建议，并明确声明这些建议概括性强，重要选择应结合个人情况与导师意见。内容涵盖中学竞赛、本科解题与择校、研究生阶段的努力和导师沟通，以及博士后期的领域学习、工具使用、公开研究、灵活调整和时间管理；末尾还列出其他数学家职业建议资源。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1954859717676496271","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<blockquote data-pid=\"pkBfNmZr\">所谓建议，往往是我们已然知晓答案，却又不愿面对时所求之物。 (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erica_Jong\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Erica Jong</a>)</blockquote><p data-pid=\"zBIcSsgO\">此处汇集了本人关于数学学术生涯各方面问题的一些建议，大致按照建议与职业生涯阶段的关联性进行了排列（当然，部分建议也适用于多个阶段）。</p><p data-pid=\"pdZspTPs\"><b>免责声明</b>：此处的建议本质上非常宽泛；我并不奢望能提供任何解决所有职业难题的「银弹」。在做出任何重要的职业决定之前，你无疑需要评估诸多特定于自身情况的因素、背景和需求，并运用充分的常识。我尤其建议，若你有导师，务必<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/talk-to-your-advisor/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">与你的导师商议此类决定</a>，因为他/她熟悉你的情况，并且很可能能够提供中肯的建议。此外，需要明确的是，此处大部分建议主要针对数学领域的学术生涯；当然，除此以外还有许多其他职业选择，但我对那些替代路径并无特别专业的见解可供分享。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"hIfCvc-7\"> 小学阶段<br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"1dqd4MZO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/advice-on-gifted-education/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">关于天才教育的建议</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。 <br/></li></ul><li data-pid=\"N2Bn-0dp\"> 中学阶段<br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"cAqN8IYH\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/advice-on-mathematics-competitions/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">关于数学竞赛的建议</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"AfDQX31m\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/which-universities-should-one-apply-to/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">应该申请哪些大学？</a><br/> </li></ul><li data-pid=\"JkNTC8IB\"> 本科阶段<br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"ydmdzKVm\"> 如何才能更擅长<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/solving-mathematical-problems/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">解决数学问题</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>？请注意，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/theres-more-to-mathematics-than-grades-and-exams-and-methods/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学的意义远不止分数、考试和方法</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>；同时，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/theres-more-to-mathematics-than-rigour-and-proofs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学的内涵也远不止严谨与证明</a>。同样重要的是，要<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/on-the-importance-of-partial-progress/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">珍视在解决问题过程中取得的阶段性进展，将其视为通往完整解决方案的关键基石</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"-CYySRVQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/don’t-base-career-decisions-on-glamour-or-fame/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">切勿仅凭光环或名望做职业决定</a>。但你应该<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/study-at-different-places/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">尝试在不同的地方求学</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"uF_gfOx4\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/does-one-have-to-be-a-genius-to-do-maths/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">在数学上取得成功一定要是天才吗？</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"nMxVPZBT\"> 我于 2022 年在哈维穆德学院毕业典礼上的演讲（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jE-vY5-3zhU&amp;t=1768s\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">视频</a>）。<br/> </li></ul><li data-pid=\"4nJdB-50\"> 研究生阶段<br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"pblfZE7E\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/work-hard/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">努力工作</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/be-professional-in-your-work/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">以专业的态度工作</a>至关重要。但同时，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/enjoy-your-work/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">享受你的工作</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>也同样重要。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"_KAVQvke\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/think-ahead/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">向前看</a>以明晰前进之路；<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/ask-yourself-dumb-questions-and-answer-them/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">向自己提出看似愚笨的问题</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>以洞察过往基础。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"fnXIXG8x\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/attend-talks-and-conferences-even-those-not-directly-related-to-your-work/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">参加学术报告和会议，即便是那些与你本人工作不直接相关的</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"RkDxNzyb\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/talk-to-your-advisor/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">与你的导师交流</a>，并且要<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/take-the-initiative/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">主动交流</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"TJAgjdFA\"> 切勿<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/dont-prematurely-obsess-on-a-single-big-problem-or-big-theory/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">过早沉溺于单一的「重大难题」或「宏大理论」</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"CYS95Tky\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/write-down-what-youve-done/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记录下你所做的工作</a>，并<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/make-your-work-available/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">将你的成果公之于众</a>。关于这一点，我有一些<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/advice-on-writing-papers/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">关于如何撰写和提交论文的建议</a>。<br/> </li></ul><li data-pid=\"Iuf9LNIJ\"> 「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.ams.org/journals/notices/202007/rnoti-p1007.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">一次惊险：一次几近失败如何推动我走向成功</a>」，T. Tao，《美国数学会会刊·通告》（<i>Notices of the American Mathematical Society</i>），2020 年 8 月。最初发表于「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.ams.org/about-us/LivingProof.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">活生生的证明：数学旅程中的坚韧故事</a>」，美国数学会，2019 年。编辑：Allison Henrich、Emille Lawrence、Matthew Pons、David Taylor。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"T_VIhOS_\"> 博士后阶段<br/> </li><ul><li data-pid=\"MMeeuTgB\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/learn-and-relearn-your-field/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习并时常温习你的领域</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>，但<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/dont-be-afraid-to-learn-things-outside-your-field/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">不要害怕学习你领域之外的知识</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"xs6Tqz8I\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/learn-the-limitations-of-your-tools/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">了解你工具的局限性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup>，但也要<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/learn-the-power-of-other-mathematicians-tools/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习其他数学家工具的强大之处</a>。尤其重要的是，你应该<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/continually-aim-just-beyond-your-current-range/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">持续挑战略高于你当前能力范围的目标</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-10\"><a href=\"#ref-10\">[10]</a></sup>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"mBE00IQr\"> 在你的研究中，既要<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/be-flexible/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">灵活变通</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-11\"><a href=\"#ref-11\">[11]</a></sup>也要<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/be-patient/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">保持耐心</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-12\"><a href=\"#ref-12\">[12]</a></sup>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"PkBZ2EDU\"> 若有机会，你绝对应该出行并展示你的研究成果。但务必<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/be-considerate-of-your-audience/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">体谅你的听众</a>；学术报告<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/talks-are-not-the-same-as-papers/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">与论文有所不同</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"fare_Nsz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/be-sceptical-of-your-own-work/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对你自己的工作保持审慎的态度</a>，并且不要害怕<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/use-the-wastebasket/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">使用废纸篓</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-13\"><a href=\"#ref-13\">[13]</a></sup>。<br/> </li></ul></ul><p data-pid=\"FERblfq6\">我亦在（缓慢地）从研究数学家的视角，整理我对时间管理的思考。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"K4dVRykO\"> 这里有一些关于此主题的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/2008/08/07/on-time-management/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">一般性想法</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-14\"><a href=\"#ref-14\">[14]</a></sup>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"jWI6ZYLI\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/batch-low-intensity-tasks-together/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">将低强度的任务集中处理</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-15\"><a href=\"#ref-15\">[15]</a></sup>，以利用规模效应并减少干扰。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"WF2QxaZu\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/2017/07/07/what-are-some-useful-but-little-known-features-of-the-tools-used-in-professional-mathematics/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">专业数学家所用工具有哪些实用却鲜为人知的功能？</a><br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"W2KACpLV\">更多建议：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"HU13tcyU\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://math.ucr.edu/home/baez/advice.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">John Baez 的职业建议页面</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"hke4nyIQ\"> Po Bronson 关于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://nymag.com/news/features/27840/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天赋与努力相对重要性的文章</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"-j94_Kyl\"> Catherine Cannizzo 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/ccannizzo/postdoc-apps\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">博士后申请指南</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"_cu8PXUT\"> Fan Chung 给<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.math.ucsd.edu/~fan/teach/gradpol.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生的建议</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"WAEmGRB5\"> Lance Fortnow 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://weblog.fortnow.com/2007/02/graduate-student-guide.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生指南</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"m6jbpQeM\"> Oded Goldreich 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.wisdom.weizmann.ac.il/~oded/on-duties.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">论我们作为科学家的职责</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"vWVu15sF\"> Richard Hamming 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.mccurley.org/advice/hamming_advice.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">灵光一闪：在你所做的一切中力求卓越</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"Apjhw8ii\"> Matt Might 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://matt.might.net/articles/phd-school-in-pictures/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">图解博士之路</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"WWvMxSEf\"> Gian-Carlo Rota 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.ams.org/notices/199701/comm-rota.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我希望当初有人教我的十堂课</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"OUQkZIj_\"> J. Michael Steele 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www-stat.wharton.upenn.edu/~steele/Rants/AdviceGS.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">给统计学研究生的建议</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"hBTdEnxD\"> Ian Stewart 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Letters-Young-Mathematician-Art-Mentoring/dp/0465082319/sr=8-1/qid=1170790056/ref=pd_bbs_1/002-2734562-8194451?ie=UTF8&amp;s=books\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">给青年数学家的信</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"QR4dH2ET\"> Ravi Vakil 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://math.stanford.edu/~vakil/potentialstudents.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">写给潜在的学生们</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"QEcER-Kf\"> Remy van Dobben de Bruyn 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://remy van dobben de bruyn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">博士后申请时间规划</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"Ym1T74t_\"> Lauren William 的「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://math.berkeley.edu/~katrin/slides/Williams-FindingJob.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">如何在数学领域找到博士后职位</a>」。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"5mTh2LzC\"> 《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://press.princeton.edu/titles/8350.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">普林斯顿数学指南</a>》中<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://press.princeton.edu/chapters/gowers/gowers_VIII_6.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「给年轻数学家的建议」</a>一节，撰稿人包括 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Atiyah\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Michael Atiyah 爵士</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Béla_Bollobás\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Béla Bollobás</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alain_Connes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Alain Connes</a>、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dusa_McDuff\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dusa McDuff</a> 和 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Sarnak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Peter Sarnak</a>。<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"cbPVTOpo\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.ams.org/cgi-bin/notices/nxgnotices.pl?fm=gen&amp;cnt=career\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《美国数学会通告》中的早期职业生涯文章</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"6uRUvhJ2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://mathgradblog.williams.edu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">美国数学会研究生博客</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"TiCKieeb\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://math.stackexchange.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mathematics Stack Exchange</a> 网站上有<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://math.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/career-development?sort=votes&amp;pagesize=15\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">许多关于职业发展的问题与解答</a>（你也可以在该网站上提出尚未被提出的其他问题）。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://mathoverflow.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MathOverflow</a> 网站类似地也有<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://mathoverflow.net/questions/tagged?tagnames=career&amp;sort=votes&amp;pagesize=15\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">关于职业发展的问题与解答</a>。最后，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://academia.stackexchange.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank